---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="B2B Marketing & Lead Generation — Pipeline That Closes | Corum8">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="description" content="Corum8 B2B marketing — outbound engines, demand generation, ABM, and content for Web3, AI, and fintech. Verified decision-makers, booked meetings, and pipeline that actually closes." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://corum8.com/services/marketing/b2b-marketing" />
  </Fragment>

<!-- 1. HERO -->
<section class="b2-hero">
  <div class="b2-blob b2-blob--a"></div>
  <div class="b2-blob b2-blob--b"></div>
  <div class="b2-hero__inner">
    <div class="b2-hero__copy reveal-up">
      <span class="b2-badge">Demand · Outbound · ABM · since 2014</span>
      <h1 class="b2-hero__h1">The team that built<br/><span class="b2-grad">$120M+ in pipeline</span><br/>for B2B founders.</h1>
      <p class="b2-hero__sub">We run B2B marketing for SaaS, Web3, AI, and fintech companies. Verified decision-makers, multi-channel sequences, and ABM that books meetings — not impressions. <strong>45,000+ meetings booked</strong> across portfolio, <strong>82% delivery rate</strong>, every reply read by a human.</p>
      <div class="b2-hero__btns">
        <a href="/contact" class="b2-btn b2-btn--fill">Get a free pipeline audit</a>
        <a href="#case-spotlight" class="b2-btn b2-btn--line">See the work →</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="b2-hero__chips">
        <li><span class="b2-chip-num">$120M+</span><span class="b2-chip-lbl">pipeline generated</span></li>
        <li class="b2-chip-div"></li>
        <li><span class="b2-chip-num">45K+</span><span class="b2-chip-lbl">meetings booked</span></li>
        <li class="b2-chip-div"></li>
        <li><span class="b2-chip-num">82%</span><span class="b2-chip-lbl">inbox delivery</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-hero__visual reveal-right">
      <div class="b2-inbox">
        <div class="b2-inbox__bar">
          <span class="b2-dot b2-dot--r"></span><span class="b2-dot b2-dot--y"></span><span class="b2-dot b2-dot--g"></span>
          <span class="b2-inbox__title">Pipeline · Q2</span>
        </div>
        <div class="b2-inbox__row b2-inbox__row--hot">
          <div class="b2-av" style="background:#f2bf22"></div>
          <div class="b2-row__body"><div class="b2-row__name">Sarah Jenkins · CTO</div><div class="b2-row__msg">Booked. Series B fintech, 200 seats.</div></div>
          <span class="b2-tag b2-tag--hot">Hot</span>
        </div>
        <div class="b2-inbox__row">
          <div class="b2-av" style="background:#0a0b10"></div>
          <div class="b2-row__body"><div class="b2-row__name">Michael Chen · VP Eng</div><div class="b2-row__msg">Demo Tuesday 3pm. Sent calendar.</div></div>
          <span class="b2-tag b2-tag--meet">Meeting</span>
        </div>
        <div class="b2-inbox__row">
          <div class="b2-av" style="background:#da9e49"></div>
          <div class="b2-row__body"><div class="b2-row__name">David Rodriguez · CMO</div><div class="b2-row__msg">Reviewing proposal internally.</div></div>
          <span class="b2-tag b2-tag--fu">Follow-up</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-fc b2-fc--m float-a">
        <div class="b2-fc__lbl">Meetings booked</div>
        <div class="b2-fc__big">+147<span>%</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-fc b2-fc--p float-b">
        <div class="b2-fc__lbl">Reply rate</div>
        <div class="b2-fc__med">14.2%</div>
        <div class="b2-fc__sub">vs 2.3% industry avg</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CHANNELS STRIP -->
<div class="b2-strip reveal-up">
  <span class="b2-strip__lbl">We run pipeline programs across</span>
  <div class="b2-strip__list">
    <span>Cold email</span><span class="bdot">·</span>
    <span>LinkedIn outbound</span><span class="bdot">·</span>
    <span>Intent-based ABM</span><span class="bdot">·</span>
    <span>Paid social</span><span class="bdot">·</span>
    <span>Webinars</span><span class="bdot">·</span>
    <span>Content syndication</span><span class="bdot">·</span>
    <span>Conference outbound</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 2. DISCIPLINES -->
<section class="b2-disc b2-pill">
  <div class="b2-section-head reveal-up">
    <span class="b2-badge">What we run</span>
    <h2 class="b2-h2">Outbound. Demand. ABM.<br/><span class="b2-grad">One revenue engine.</span></h2>
    <p class="b2-section-head__sub">Most B2B agencies sell you a single channel and call it a strategy. We build the engine that makes channels feed each other.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="b2-disc-grid">
    <div class="b2-disc-card reveal-stagger">
      <div class="b2-disc-card__img">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556761175-5973dc0f32e7?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Outbound" />
        <span class="b2-disc-card__num">01</span>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-disc-card__body">
        <h3>Outbound &amp; Email Engines</h3>
        <p>Verified decision-makers, multi-channel sequences, AI-personalized openers. Inbox-safe infrastructure with sub-1% bounce rates.</p>
        <ul><li>Domain warm-up &amp; deliverability</li><li>Apollo / Clay / Sales Navigator stacks</li><li>Reply handling &amp; meeting booking</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-disc-card reveal-stagger">
      <div class="b2-disc-card__img">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551836022-deb4988cc6c0?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Demand" />
        <span class="b2-disc-card__num">02</span>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-disc-card__body">
        <h3>Demand Generation</h3>
        <p>Paid social, content syndication, webinars, and intent-data programs that put your brand in front of buyers who are already researching your category.</p>
        <ul><li>LinkedIn paid + retargeting</li><li>G2 / TrustRadius / 6sense plays</li><li>Webinar &amp; ebook funnels</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-disc-card reveal-stagger">
      <div class="b2-disc-card__img">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="ABM" />
        <span class="b2-disc-card__num">03</span>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-disc-card__body">
        <h3>Account-Based Marketing</h3>
        <p>Tier-1 target lists, multi-stakeholder orchestration, and personalized landing pages for each named account. Built for $50K+ ACV.</p>
        <ul><li>1:1 / 1:few / 1:many tiers</li><li>Custom landing pages per account</li><li>SDR + AE alignment loops</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3. SPLIT PHOTO -->
<section class="b2-split-photo">
  <div class="b2-split-photo__img reveal-left">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Sales call" />
    <div class="b2-split-photo__badge">
      <span class="b2-split-photo__badge-num">14.2%</span>
      <span class="b2-split-photo__badge-lbl">avg reply rate</span>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-split-photo__chip float-a">
      <span class="green">●</span> 23 meetings · this week
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="b2-split-photo__copy reveal-right">
    <span class="b2-badge">Why us</span>
    <h2 class="b2-h2">Replies happen. <span class="b2-grad">Meetings get booked.</span><br/>Pipeline closes.</h2>
    <p>Most B2B agencies report on emails sent and impressions served. We report on qualified meetings, pipeline value, and the deals that closed because of a sequence we wrote.</p>
    <div class="b2-mini-stats">
      <div class="b2-mini-stat"><span>$120M+</span><small>pipeline generated</small></div>
      <div class="b2-mini-stat"><span>45K+</span><small>meetings booked</small></div>
      <div class="b2-mini-stat"><span>82%</span><small>inbox delivery</small></div>
    </div>
    <a href="/case-studies" class="b2-btn b2-btn--fill">See case studies</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4. PROCESS -->
<section class="b2-process">
  <div class="b2-section-head reveal-up">
    <span class="b2-badge">How we work</span>
    <h2 class="b2-h2">From ICP to closed-won.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="b2-process-grid">
    <div class="b2-proc-card reveal-stagger">
      <div class="b2-proc-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559526324-4b87b5e36e44?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" /><span class="b2-proc-num">01</span></div>
      <h3>ICP &amp; offer audit</h3><p>We map your ideal customer profile, current win rate, lost-deal patterns, and the offer angles that would actually convert this quarter.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-proc-card reveal-stagger">
      <div class="b2-proc-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581291518633-83b4ebd1d83e?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" /><span class="b2-proc-num">02</span></div>
      <h3>List build &amp; enrich</h3><p>Verified decision-makers from Apollo, Sales Navigator, Clay, and intent platforms. Triple-verified emails, sub-1% bounce.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-proc-card reveal-stagger">
      <div class="b2-proc-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551836022-deb4988cc6c0?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" /><span class="b2-proc-num">03</span></div>
      <h3>Sequences &amp; sends</h3><p>Multi-channel sequences across email, LinkedIn, and warm intros. AI-personalized openers, hand-edited where it matters.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-proc-card reveal-stagger">
      <div class="b2-proc-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" /><span class="b2-proc-num">04</span></div>
      <h3>Reply &amp; book</h3><p>Every reply read by a human within an hour. Meetings booked directly into your AE's calendar with full context.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5. WHY US -->
<section class="b2-why">
  <div class="b2-section-head reveal-up">
    <span class="b2-badge">Why Corum8 vs. another agency</span>
    <h2 class="b2-h2">Most agencies send emails.<br/>We book <span class="b2-grad">meetings that close.</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="b2-why__inner reveal-up">
    <div class="b2-why__col b2-why__col--them">
      <div class="b2-why__col-h">A typical B2B agency</div>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="b2-x">×</span> Reports emails sent and open rate as the win</li>
        <li><span class="b2-x">×</span> Generic templates, scraped lists, 30%+ bounce</li>
        <li><span class="b2-x">×</span> No reply handling — leaves replies for you</li>
        <li><span class="b2-x">×</span> Single-channel: email-only or LinkedIn-only</li>
        <li><span class="b2-x">×</span> Doesn't speak SaaS, Web3, AI, or fintech buyer language</li>
        <li><span class="b2-x">×</span> Books "meetings" with junior interns or no-shows</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-why__col b2-why__col--us">
      <div class="b2-why__col-h b2-why__col-h--us">Corum8</div>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="b2-tick">✓</span> Reports qualified meetings, pipeline value, deals closed</li>
        <li><span class="b2-tick">✓</span> Triple-verified contacts, sub-1% bounce, inbox-safe infra</li>
        <li><span class="b2-tick">✓</span> Every reply handled by a human, meetings booked for you</li>
        <li><span class="b2-tick">✓</span> Email + LinkedIn + paid + ABM running as one engine</li>
        <li><span class="b2-tick">✓</span> Native to SaaS, Web3, AI, fintech buyer psychology</li>
        <li><span class="b2-tick">✓</span> $120M+ pipeline, 45K+ meetings, 82% delivery rate</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="b2-why__cta reveal-up">
    <span class="b2-why__cta-text">Want to see how we'd build yours?</span>
    <a href="/contact" class="b2-btn b2-btn--fill">Get a free pipeline audit →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5b. CHANNELS GRID -->
<section class="b2-channels b2-pill">
  <div class="b2-channels__inner">
    <div class="b2-section-head reveal-up">
      <span class="b2-badge">Channel expertise</span>
      <h2 class="b2-h2">Different channels.<br/>Different playbooks.</h2>
      <p class="b2-section-head__sub">Each channel has its own delivery rules, buyer behavior, and ROI curve. We've shipped on all of them — and we know which ones move pipeline for your category.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="b2-chan-grid">
      <div class="b2-chan-card reveal-stagger">
        <div class="b2-chan-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633613286848-e6f43bbafb8d?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Cold email" /><span class="b2-chan-card__lbl">Cold Email</span></div>
        <div class="b2-chan-card__body"><p>Inbox-safe infrastructure, AI-personalized openers, multi-domain rotation. The default outbound channel for $10K–$500K ACV.</p><span class="b2-chan-card__tag">Outbound · Volume · Predictable</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-chan-card reveal-stagger">
        <div class="b2-chan-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611944212129-29977ae1398c?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="LinkedIn" /><span class="b2-chan-card__lbl">LinkedIn Outbound</span></div>
        <div class="b2-chan-card__body"><p>Founder-led DMs, Sales Navigator targeting, content amplification. Where senior buyers actually respond to a cold message.</p><span class="b2-chan-card__tag">Senior buyers · 1:1 · Founder-led</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-chan-card reveal-stagger">
        <div class="b2-chan-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="ABM" /><span class="b2-chan-card__lbl">ABM</span></div>
        <div class="b2-chan-card__body"><p>1:1 and 1:few orchestration on named accounts — landing pages, ads, gifting, multi-stakeholder sequencing for $50K+ ACV.</p><span class="b2-chan-card__tag">Enterprise · $50K+ ACV</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-chan-card reveal-stagger">
        <div class="b2-chan-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611224923853-80b023f02d71?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Paid social" /><span class="b2-chan-card__lbl">Paid Social</span></div>
        <div class="b2-chan-card__body"><p>LinkedIn-led demand gen with tightly defined ICPs, retargeting clusters, and offer-led creative. Ties directly to pipeline, not MQLs.</p><span class="b2-chan-card__tag">LinkedIn · Demand · Pipeline</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-chan-card reveal-stagger">
        <div class="b2-chan-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492619375914-88005aa9e8fb?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Webinars" /><span class="b2-chan-card__lbl">Webinars &amp; Events</span></div>
        <div class="b2-chan-card__body"><p>Topic-led webinars, partner co-marketing, in-person dinners. The highest-converting top-of-funnel for technical buyers.</p><span class="b2-chan-card__tag">Top-of-funnel · Technical</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-chan-card reveal-stagger">
        <div class="b2-chan-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1432888622747-4eb9a8efeb07?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Intent" /><span class="b2-chan-card__lbl">Intent &amp; Reviews</span></div>
        <div class="b2-chan-card__body"><p>G2, TrustRadius, Capterra, 6sense, Bombora. We surface accounts already researching your category — before competitors notice.</p><span class="b2-chan-card__tag">Intent · Reviews · 6sense</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-chan-card reveal-stagger">
        <div class="b2-chan-card__img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504711434969-e33886168f5c?w=600&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Content" /><span class="b2-chan-card__lbl">Content Syndication</span></div>
        <div class="b2-chan-card__body"><p>Premium B2B publisher placements, gated whitepaper distribution, executive newsletters. Where IT and finance buyers read.</p><span class="b2-chan-card__tag">Mid-funnel · Decision-maker</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="b2-chan-card b2-chan-card--more reveal-stagger">
        <div class="b2-chan-card__more-inner">
          <div class="b2-chan-card__more-num">+ many more</div>
          <p>Conference outbound, partner co-sell, podcast tours, executive dinners — wherever your buyers actually are, we ship there too.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="b2-chan-card__more-cta">Ask about a channel →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 6. CASE STUDY -->
<section class="b2-case b2-pill" id="case-spotlight">
  <div class="b2-case__bg"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737711867-e3b97375f902?w=1400&q=70&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /><div class="b2-case__overlay"></div></div>
  <div class="b2-case__inner reveal-up">
    <span class="b2-case__tag">Case study · SaaS Series-B</span>
    <h2 class="b2-case__h2">From 4 demos a month to<br/>23 qualified meetings a week.</h2>
    <p class="b2-case__body">A Series-B B2B SaaS came to us with a single SDR, a stalled pipeline, and a CMO under pressure. We rebuilt their outbound stack — Apollo for sourcing, Smartlead for sends, Clay for enrichment, Calendly for booking — and added LinkedIn outbound on top. Within one quarter, qualified pipeline grew 6× and CAC payback halved.</p>
    <div class="b2-case__metrics">
      <div><span>23/wk</span><small>qualified meetings</small></div>
      <div><span>6×</span><small>pipeline growth</small></div>
      <div><span>−52%</span><small>CAC payback</small></div>
    </div>
    <a href="/case-studies" class="b2-btn b2-btn--outline-white">Read all case studies →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 7. TESTIMONIALS -->
<section class="b2-testi">
  <div class="b2-section-head reveal-up">
    <span class="b2-badge">Client outcomes</span>
    <h2 class="b2-h2">What revenue leaders say.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="b2-testi-grid">
    <div class="b2-testi-card reveal-stagger"><div class="b2-testi-img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?w=120&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=face" alt="" /></div><div class="b2-stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>"Corum8's outbound engine fundamentally changed our business. We went from referrals only to 20+ qualified enterprise demos every week. The reply handling alone is worth what we pay them."</blockquote><div class="b2-testi-name">Alex Mercer</div><div class="b2-testi-role">VP Sales · SaaSify · NYC</div></div>
    <div class="b2-testi-card reveal-stagger"><div class="b2-testi-img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438761681033-6461ffad8d80?w=120&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=face" alt="" /></div><div class="b2-stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>"Lead quality is unmatched. Prospects show up to calls knowing what we do, ready to talk pricing. It's the highest-ROI channel we have. Three quarters in, still our best decision."</blockquote><div class="b2-testi-name">Samantha Wright</div><div class="b2-testi-role">Founder · DataSync · London</div></div>
    <div class="b2-testi-card reveal-stagger"><div class="b2-testi-img"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=120&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=face" alt="" /></div><div class="b2-stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>"We hired two outbound agencies before Corum8. Both burned our domain reputation. These folks rebuilt our deliverability from scratch and we're now booking enterprise meetings every week."</blockquote><div class="b2-testi-name">Kenji Nakamura</div><div class="b2-testi-role">CRO · AI infrastructure · Tokyo</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 8. FAQ -->
<section class="b2-faq">
  <div class="b2-section-head reveal-up"><span class="b2-badge">FAQ</span><h2 class="b2-h2">Questions revenue leaders ask.</h2></div>
  <div class="b2-faq-list reveal-up">
    <div class="b2-faq-item"><button class="b2-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What's the typical reply rate on a Corum8 outbound program?<span class="b2-chevron"></span></button><div class="b2-faq-a"><strong>Across portfolio our average reply rate sits at 14.2% — roughly 6× the cold-email industry average of ~2.3%.</strong> The driver is verified contact data, AI-personalized openers hand-edited at the top of every sequence, and inbox-safe infrastructure that keeps domains out of spam.</div></div>
    <div class="b2-faq-item"><button class="b2-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How do you protect our domain reputation?<span class="b2-chevron"></span></button><div class="b2-faq-a"><strong>We never send from your primary domain.</strong> We register and warm secondary sending domains, configure DKIM, SPF, DMARC properly, throttle volume per inbox, and rotate across multiple sending mailboxes. Your main domain stays clean for transactional and customer email.</div></div>
    <div class="b2-faq-item"><button class="b2-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Do you handle replies and book meetings, or just send?<span class="b2-chevron"></span></button><div class="b2-faq-a"><strong>We handle every reply.</strong> A Corum8 SDR reads each response within an hour during business windows, qualifies the prospect, handles initial objections, and books the meeting directly onto your AE's calendar with full context. You only get involved when a qualified meeting is on your calendar.</div></div>
    <div class="b2-faq-item"><button class="b2-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What contact data sources do you use?<span class="b2-chevron"></span></button><div class="b2-faq-a"><strong>Apollo, Sales Navigator, Clay, ZoomInfo, and Cognism — triple-verified through ZeroBounce or NeverBounce before any send.</strong> Sub-1% bounce rate on every campaign. We also use intent platforms like 6sense and Bombora to surface accounts already researching your category.</div></div>
    <div class="b2-faq-item"><button class="b2-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Can you run ABM for enterprise accounts?<span class="b2-chevron"></span></button><div class="b2-faq-a"><strong>Yes — 1:1, 1:few, and 1:many ABM are part of our regular engagements, especially for clients with $50K+ ACV.</strong> Custom landing pages per account, multi-stakeholder sequencing, executive gifting, and ad orchestration on LinkedIn, RollWorks, or 6sense — all aligned to your AE's account plans.</div></div>
    <div class="b2-faq-item"><button class="b2-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How do you measure success?<span class="b2-chevron"></span></button><div class="b2-faq-a"><strong>Qualified meetings booked, pipeline value generated, and deals closed — not opens, clicks, or impressions.</strong> Every monthly review shows accounts engaged, meetings held, pipeline added, and (with your CRM access) closed-won attribution. Vanity metrics are reported but not optimized for.</div></div>
    <div class="b2-faq-item"><button class="b2-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Do you cover non-English markets?<span class="b2-chevron"></span></button><div class="b2-faq-a"><strong>Yes — we run B2B outbound in 14 languages including Spanish, German, French, Mandarin, Japanese, and Korean.</strong> Native-speaker copywriters and SDRs, regional ICPs, and timezone-aligned reply handling. Especially relevant for clients selling enterprise software into EMEA or APAC.</div></div>
    <div class="b2-faq-item"><button class="b2-faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How does Corum8 work alongside our internal SDR team?<span class="b2-chevron"></span></button><div class="b2-faq-a"><strong>We complement, not replace.</strong> Most clients keep their internal SDRs on inbound and named-account expansion while we handle the high-volume outbound layer your team doesn't have bandwidth for. Weekly syncs ensure no double-touch on accounts and that messaging stays aligned.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

